{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-2-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_2_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:source:35c41703812eb679e8c8b4c503690ae5b1ecc7b95d2643163a96ae1c016d27d2\",\"evidence:source:f17758b91395ba7ce7339162e3a8de3e1d2e268e80f5c10e2b0af4554e46bd3c\",\"evidence:source:d7a688391e28231c21325fab8db56be021368c494f904ceb04ef9db207f77735\",\"evidence:source:db97597a305a74992da8b2e02ee70017186d03e065a1a1e911865d0f1031d5b8\",\"evidence:source:b2266d63f39acabb1907296eea765c6e5042f59bbb814bba1a7b3c8238cb9b3d\",\"evidence:source:2e8603b57f20519f04494375af65e08e6a5fb34d72223b6debf0a5439685ee52\",\"evidence:source:f51011f85a2bea698ff3b96318145bf9359cf91d77a6713ac8c773748b59932c\",\"evidence:source:01641c9d9065e195a70d8624d53e9e6b5e6df8a2d048009ebcdeecb49c7f6e84\",\"evidence:source:fffe4ca0578e1c5423076449091396f16013918e83d85b223fbc525bd4341e39\",\"evidence:source:a0ccda919261d50457b464263a4c2a8d0c5d67ffec9baf8ff110173c85f43355\",\"evidence:source:c717f77783e1c554637400c26db54f1c6aa0cba6ac008e377cf200e48db8debe\"],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"p_001\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"实际适应症：本研究针对的实际适应症为特发性肺纤维化（IPF）。该适应症为已确认的研究立项事实，后续临床问题、标准治疗、未满足需求及证据缺口均应围绕IPF人群展开，不得以通用疾病介绍或其他注册关键词替代。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_002\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"临床问题：【待补充：特发性肺纤维化当前疾病负担与治疗困境的具体内容：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_003\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"标准治疗：当前标准治疗（SOC）尚待项目化确认。【待补充：特发性肺纤维化当前标准治疗方案及其可核查依据：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_004\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"未满足需求：【待补充：特发性肺纤维化目标人群尚未满足的临床需求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_005\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"证据缺口与研究不确定性：【待补充：本研究拟解决的、现有证据无法回答的不确定性：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"p_006\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"研究理论依据的机制层面：在已确认事实中，研究药物为抗纤维化小分子口服药物。该机制是否能够针对上述未满足需求并填补证据缺口，必须在实际适应症、临床问题、标准治疗及未满足需求逐项确认后才能成立；在此之前，不应作疗效或营销性推断。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"51b1f57c7a528bc0b19a8881553127cdf413fbd2776e404b9b61331a0e5a7174"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:72cb89888d8d89845e9a80cc5e466dbf5138497a4ec88772a5564309b14e1b3c:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:72cb89888d8d89845e9a80cc5e466dbf5138497a4ec88772a5564309b14e1b3c:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"0446a0fb5c562b4f770415ac0867cf26049633162e19e926d7777457839e89b0","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"9789b372-4fc0-41b8-8aba-9efbc7dea77c","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}